# Wave W17-AA (Route 218): cause pine — a shore-end pine in deep harbour greens, tiered and rain-dark, its highlight lifted clear, standing in plain shore grass baked into the tile (the causeway ships no ground register — the frame trees stand in their own shore grass, as every fleet tree tile carries its footing). Route 218’s own tree — split from Foamline Path’s shore pine by weather entire (rain-dark vs sunlit) and from Route 222’s solar pine by colour: this crown is deep green under rain, that one yellow-green in sun.
